    "/api/sis-data-api/v1/ethos/courses/list": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Courses records for a unique combination of effective term, subject code and course number.<br/><br/>The course GUIDs are generated and stored in SCBCGID table, for each unique combination of subject code, course number and effective term from SCBCRSE, SCRLEVL, SCRGMOD, SCRSCHD, SCBDESC, SCRINTG, SCRSYLN and SCRATTR tables. All records from SCBCGID are retrieved.<br/><br/>Returns all courses containing the titles values passed.<br/>?criteria={\"titles\":[{\"value\":\"Principles of Marketing\"},{\"value\":\"Marketing segments\"}]} <br/><br/>Returns all courses for the subject ID passed.<br/>?criteria={\"subject\":{\"id\":\"4a0c95f7-0903-408a-8694-77b313809909\"}}<br/><br/>Not Supported<br/>?criteria={\"topic\": {\"id\": $id}}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the categories ID passed.<br/>?criteria={\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"2582835d-3e14-435b-b74f-4311746987ce\"}]}<br/><br/><br/>Returns all courses for the course number passed.<br/>?criteria={\"number\":\"015\"}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the academic level ID passed.<br/>?criteria={\"academicLevels\":[{\"id\":\"e3d1af10-26ac-4a29-b56c-b70c34471acb\"}]}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the owningInstitutionUnits IDs passed. A Banner course can have one college, one division and one department associated. If a filter request has multiple college/division/department IDs, an empty array is returned.<br/>?criteria={\"owningInstitutionUnits\":[{\"institutionUnit\":{\"id\":\"43446b13-2b16-4fcb-90e0-6529d802c8a9\"}}]}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the instructional method(schedule type) ID passed.<br/>?criteria={\"instructionalMethodDetails\":[{\"instructionalMethod\":{\"id\":\"8e7c7b1b-81d2-4281-a8c8-0c73a04a29f4\"}}]}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the schedulingStartOn date passed.<br/>?criteria={\"schedulingStartOn\":\"2016-01-01\"}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the schedulingEndOn date passed.<br/>?criteria={\"schedulingEndOn\":\"2016-01-01\"}<br/><br/>Returns all courses for the effective term ID passed.<br/>/courses?criteria={\"administrativePeriod\":{\"id\":\"28e62292-1d7a-40d3-918b-19c91db4f7db\"}}<br/><br/>Returns all course records that have a status that identifies the course as active and effective as of the provided date.<br/>?criteria={\"activeOn\":\"2018-05-20\"}&criteriaPlaceholder=activeOn<br/>",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://resources.elluciancloud.com/bundle/banner_api_courses_16.1.0/page/courses.html"
        },
        "operationId": "list",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "refresh",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteria",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteriaPlaceholder",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "max",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "offset",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PagedResult"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Course"
                          },
                          "type": "array"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "summary": "",
        "tags": [
          "courses"
        ]
      }
    },
