    "/api/sis-data-api/v1/ethos/persons/list": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Returns a paged listing of all the person records from SPRIDEN where SPRIDEN_ENTITY_IND ='P'.\n\nTitle\n\nReturns all persons records with title equals the value passed. Filter is done only on the current name records (SPRIDEN_CHANGE_IND = null).\n?criteria={\"names\":[{\"title\":\"Mr.\"}]}\n\nFirst Name\n\nReturns all persons records whose first name starts with the value passed. Filter is done only on the current name records (SPRIDEN_CHANGE_IND = null).\n\n?criteria={\"names\":[{\"firstName\":\"James\"}]}\n\nMiddle Name\n\nReturns all persons records whose middle name contains the value passed. Filter is done only on the current name records (SPRIDEN_CHANGE_IND = null).\n\n?criteria={\"names\":[{\"middleName\":\"Emory\"}]}\n\nLast Name Prefix\n\nReturns all persons records with last name prefix equals the value passed. Filter is done only on the current name records (SPRIDEN_CHANGE_IND = null).\n\n?criteria={\"names\":[{\"lastNamePrefix\":\"Van\"}]}\n\nLast Name\n\nReturns all persons records whose last name starts with the value passed. Filter is done only on the current name records (SPRIDEN_CHANGE_IND = null).\n\n?criteria={\"names\":[{\"lastName\":\"Abbot\"}]}\n\nRole\n\nReturns all persons for the role passed.\n\n?criteria={\"roles\":[{\"role\":\"instructor\"}]}\n\nCredentials\n\nReturns all persons for the credential type and value passed\n\n?criteria={\"credentials\":[{\"type\":\"bannerId\",\"value\":\"A00000718\"}]}\n\nAlternative Credentials\n\nReturns persons for the alternative credentials passed. Both alternative credential type and value are required.\n\n?criteria={\"alternativeCredentials\":[{\"type\":{\"id\":\"6cc4a853-2ff4-4ef3-9595-5d3eddcbbbcd\"},\"value\":\"DEANNE\"}]}\n\nEmail Address\n\nReturns all persons who have the email address passed. Filter will search for all active email records with email types mapped in GORICCR setting EMAILS.\nEMAILTYPE.\n\n?criteria={\"emails\":[{\"address\":\"sample@ellucian.xyz\"}]}\n\nPerson Filters\n\nReturns all persons for the person population selection filter id passed.\n\n?criteria={\"personFilter\":\"6729a17e-3dfa-4517-95df-acdf160c24ab\"}&criteriaPlaceholder=personFilter\n\n?criteria={\"personFilter\":{\"id\":\"cb3ebfe9-4a31-4933-a504-04d110413a29\"}}&criteriaPlaceholder=personFilter\n",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://resources.elluciancloud.com/bundle/banner_api_persons_12.3.0/page/persons.html"
        },
        "operationId": "list",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "refresh",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteria",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteriaPlaceholder",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "max",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "offset",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PagedResult"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Person"
                          },
                          "type": "array"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "summary": "",
        "tags": [
          "persons"
        ]
      }
    },
