    "/api/sis-data-api/v1/ethos/section-registrations/list": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Section registrations records from SFRSTCR excluding the registration records with 'pending' status.<br/><br/>If the registration status code (STVRSTS_CODE) is mapped to a valid registration sectionRegistrationStatusReason enumeration (registered, withdrawn, dropped, canceled) in the API configuration setting REGISTRATION.STATUS.REASON.V4, the API publishes the registration status property with the associated registration 'status.detail.id'. If the registration status code on a registration record is not mapped to a valid enumeration on this setting, the API only retrieves registration status enumeration but does not publish the 'status.detail.id' property.<br/><br/>A person registered for a section.<br/>?criteria={\"registrant\":{\"id\":\"5674f28b-b216-4055-b236-81a922d93b4c\"}}<br/><br/>An instance of a course for which a person is registering.<br/>?criteria={\"section\":{\"id\":\"cfa09192-7e0b-46ca-aaa3-13b0c659f9cc\"}}<br/><br/>Filter to return section registrations associated with a specific term / academic period.<br/>?criteria={\"academicPeriod\":{\"id\":\"86a94f19-9216-4c52-a4b0-31e3bf674280\"}}&criteriaPlaceholder=academicPeriod<br/><br/>Filter to return section registrations associated with a specific instructor/faculty.<br/>?criteria={\"sectionInstructor\":{\"id\":\"86a94f19-9216-4c52-a4b0-31e3bf674280\"}}&criteriaPlaceholder=sectionInstructor<br/><br/>Filter to return section registrations by status and academic period.<br/>?criteria={\"statuses\":[{\"detail\":{\"id\":\"fcdf4931-172d-43a0-87c5-08a083f79503\"}}],\"academicPeriod\":{\"id\":\"86a94f19-9216-4c52-a4b0-31e3bf674280\"}}&criteriaPlaceholder=registrationStatusesByAcademicPeriod<br/>",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://resources.elluciancloud.com/bundle/banner_api_section_registrations_16.1.0/page/section-registrations.html"
        },
        "operationId": "list",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "refresh",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
