    "/api/sis-data-api/v1/ethos/student-academic-credentials/list": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Returns a paged listing of all the outcome curriculum records associated with an awarded degree/outcome record. In addition to publishing the current and active programs from SORLCUR table and associated fields of study from SORLFOS table, graduation and honors information are also retrieved from SHRDGMR table.\n\nStudent\n\nThe student who has been awarded an academic credential.\n\n?criteria={\"student\":{\"id\":\"4a0c95f7-0903-408a-8694-77b313809909\"}}\n\nStudent Program\n\nThe academic program associated with the academic credential.\n\n?criteria={\"studentProgram\":{\"id\":\"3efc95f7-0903-408a-8694-77b313806639\"}}\n\nAcademic Level\n\nThe academic level associated with the academic credential.\n\n?criteria={\"academicLevel\":{\"id\":\"8tfc95f7-0903-408a-8694-77b313806609\"}}\n\nCredentials\n\nThe academic credential that has been awarded.\n\n?criteria={\"credentials\":[{\"credential\":{\"id\":\"7a6e9b82-e78b-47db-9f30-5becff004921\"}}]}\n\nGraduation Academic Period\n\nThe academic period in which the student graduated.\n\n?criteria={\"graduationAcademicPeriod\":{\"id\":\"b24b5455-e030-4035-88a0-ef999e9d4171\"}}\n\nGraduated On\n\nSupported operators are $gt, $gte, $lt, $lte, or the default of equals if operator is not specified.\nReturns all student academic credentials for the graduated on date passed.\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":\"1995-02-06\"}\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":{\"$eq\":\"1995-01-01\"}}\n\nReturns all student academic credentials with graduated on date less than the graduated on date passed.\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":{\"$lt\":\"1995-01-01\"}}\n\nReturns all student academic credentials with graduated on date less than equals to the graduated on date passed.\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":{\"$lte\":\"1995-01-01\"}}\n\nReturns all student academic credentials with graduated on date greater than the graduated on date passed.\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":{\"$gt\":\"1995-01-01\"}}\n\nReturns all student academic credentials with graduated on date greater than equals to the graduated on date passed.\n\n?criteria={\"graduatedOn\":{\"$gte\":\"1995-01-01\"}}\n",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://resources.elluciancloud.com/bundle/banner_api_ethos_api_student_academic_credentials_1.0.0/page/student-academic-credentials.html"
        },
        "operationId": "list",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "refresh",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "default": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteria",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "criteriaPlaceholder",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "max",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "offset",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PagedResult"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StudentAcademicCredential"
                          },
                          "type": "array"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "summary": "",
        "tags": [
          "student-academic-credentials"
        ]
      }
    },
